  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial Release\n      ========================\n      • AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption with integrity verification\n      • PBKDF2 key derivation with 100,000 iterations and SHA-256\n      • Full cross-platform compatibility with Node.js implementation\n      • Support for .NET 6.0+ and .NET 8.0+ with conditional compilation\n      • Comprehensive security validation (tampering detection, key separation)\n      • High-performance encryption/decryption with proper resource disposal\n      • Complete API documentation and cross-platform test suite\n      • Designed with enterprise-grade security standards",
